[152.016607, "o", "The flag is `--output-spaces`.\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nqsiprep /data /out participant --fs-license-file /license.txt --output-spaces T1w MNI152NLin2009cAsym:res-2\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis writes preprocessed DWI in native T1w space and in MNI152NLin2009cAsym at 2 mm isotropic resolution. The `:res-2` suffix is optional but recommended for MNI outputs to avoid large file sizes at native (typically 1.25 mm) resolution.\r\n"]
